t to `pro` for higher-quality responses on complex tasks.\\n\\n**Cost note:** pro mode spends far more reasoning tokens per request, so a typical request costs several times more than the same request on GPT-6 Luna and takes much longer to complete. It is intended for hard, high-stakes problems where the extra accuracy justifies the cost. For everyday coding, agentic, and chat workloads, use [GPT-6 Luna](https://openrouter.ai/openai/gpt-6-luna) instead.\\n\\nLearn more in OpenAI's docs: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/reasoning#reasoning-mode\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-22T18:13:11.132Z\",\"context_length\":1050000,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"openai/gpt-6-luna-pro:batch\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"openai/gpt-6-luna-pro-20260922:batch\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000005\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.00000005\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000001\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000025\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.00000025\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.000000375\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.000000005\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.000000005\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.00000001\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Write\",\"price\":\"0.0000000625\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000000625\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.000000125\"}]},{\"kind\":\"unit\",\"sku_label\":\"Web Search\",\"price\":\"0.01\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000,\"unitLabel\":\"/1K calls\",\"isServerTool\":true}],\"is_fr